ax1250sMauthSystemTrap  TRAP-TYPE
	ENTERPRISE      ax1250s
	VARIABLES       { ax1250sAuthSysName, ax1250sAuthIfIndex, ax1250sAuthSupplicantMac, ax1250sAuthMessage }
